# Posters and channel logos in test-media/ are original artwork made for this playlist (no film stills).
# The app treats URLs containing "/movie/" as movies and "/series/" + SxxExx as series episodes;
# the "#/movie/" and "#/series/" fragments only mark the type and are not sent to the server.

